  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Star Form blessed land, Star Form land spirit shows Fang Yuan a centipede-like Immortal Gu: thin and long like an arm, black like iron, flying in a zigzag with short horizontal segments that light up like blue fireflies.",
        "chapters": [
          852
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_star_form_blessed_land",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s transactions with Sixth Hair, Eat Strength, Cleanse Soul, Fixed Immortal Travel, Star Shoot, Star Mark, and Starlight are said to have self-detonated through Fang Yuan’s special will, with Ying Wu Xie unable to save them, though that information could be false.",
        "chapters": [
          1079
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "transactions-with-sixth-hair",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_sixth_hair",
          "move_eat_strength",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
          "char_ying_wu_xie"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the star path Immortal Gu, only star eyes Immortal Gu comes back to Fang Yuan after the transactions, and he does not know whether Star Shoot, Star Mark, Starlight, and Star Thought are in Ying Wu Xie’s hands or whether they still exist.",
        "chapters": [
          1082
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "after-the-transactions",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
